WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.013
A running total uses an ordered window frame The
calculation starts

00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:11.510
at the beginning of the partition and ends at the
current row As the current

00:00:11.523 --> 00:00:17.202
row moves forward the frame grows If we partition by
department

00:00:17.465 --> 00:00:19.781
each department gets its own running total
